                "entry_id": "e09cfc93-b1e2-36bd-826b-a328d9f33310",
                "word": "ressassement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "21a7b292-8bbf-41ad-a764-85a882cd4bbc",
                        "entry_id": "e09cfc93-b1e2-36bd-826b-a328d9f33310",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ressassements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                        "entry_id": "e09cfc93-b1e2-36bd-826b-a328d9f33310",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action de ressasser."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "693416c4-67e0-45a4-95bf-8a867ebe582a",
                                "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                                "text": "Il supportait calmement ces ressassements incessants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3dbf65f-f416-4735-9bfd-a1257f1bbc9b",
                                "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                                "text": "Et peut-être n’y avait-il rien de plus poignant et de plus risible dans cette œuvre que le portrait de cet homme monstrueusement tatoué, ce corps peint qui semblait monter la garde devant chaque ressassement du tableau."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09d2e296-3929-43d3-833a-72b7d87101d6",
                                "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                                "text": "C’est négliger le changement d’âme qui s’opérait en Gérios à l’automne d’une vie d’échecs et de ressassements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "200bacba-44b1-4a52-9a07-036e95923c17",
                                "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                                "text": "Le ressassement fascine et dénote les questionnements obsédants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "92170082-6eda-49d2-b262-262f7275c512",
                                "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                                "text": "Peu importe si je me répète, une autre règle mnémonique est le ressassement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f19a340-c4cf-40f6-a2d7-693985f629bf",
                                "sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                                "text": "Pendant plusieurs mois, Dominique ne sortit pas du ressassement."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5cc76b2d-10f7-46ca-9c27-0c214ab46d2d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e09cfc93-b1e2-36bd-826b-a328d9f33310",
                        "source_sense_id": "66c4f69c-ec4f-3e80-a9ec-9af7d8337f5b",
                        "target_lang_word": "hark back",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hark back",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68639760-6d9c-3a41-8954-4acee32d410a",
                                        "entry_id": "519e82dc-1630-3599-b81c-65e05884ea0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of hounds: to retrace a course in order to pick up the lost scent of prey."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06f3f340-1637-37ab-aa58-062e02815eb4",
                                        "entry_id": "519e82dc-1630-3599-b81c-65e05884ea0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To return to where one has previously been; to retrace one's steps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d7565de-899f-4245-ac89-5aa1b8a08bd0",
                                                "sense_id": "06f3f340-1637-37ab-aa58-062e02815eb4",
                                                "text": "He must have overshot the mark, and must hark back. So he turned his weary horse's head, and made his way back along the road to the spot where his spoor struck into it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f13cd6f-57e6-3d50-a6e2-f7ff8a0271af",
                                        "entry_id": "519e82dc-1630-3599-b81c-65e05884ea0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To allude, return, or revert (to a subject previously mentioned, etc.); also, to evoke, or long or pine for (a past era or event)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e942c8b7-2779-4aac-ac83-2ca0fe239f90",
                                                "sense_id": "0f13cd6f-57e6-3d50-a6e2-f7ff8a0271af",
                                                "text": "Mr. Flemyng, who had been assuaging his thirst with more champagne during the afternoon, had harked back to the subject of his morning's discourse, and was laying down an authoritative scheme of ethics, in the course of which sundry hard words, such as transcendentalism, pseudo-materialism and the like, lost a syllable here and there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a890550-f194-4052-a30c-3d208128c583",
                                                "sense_id": "0f13cd6f-57e6-3d50-a6e2-f7ff8a0271af",
                                                "text": "Harking back to the theme of a series of speeches he [George W. Bush] delivered last week, he said he was reminded that \"there's still an enemy out there that would like to inflict the same kind of damage again.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "000d535e-8f60-385d-a614-36ab3cd3a9ba",
                                        "entry_id": "519e82dc-1630-3599-b81c-65e05884ea0a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To call back (hounds); to recall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
